{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.nichika.tribute.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "事务所的桌上摊着一份企划书",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.nichika.tribute.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.nichika.tribute.first",
    "idolId": "nichika",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "事务所的桌上摊着一份企划书。封面上印着一个已经很久没被人提起的名字。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "上周接到的委托，想先跟你们两个说。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "诶，什么什么什么！？是我们两个人一起的事情吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "八雲なみ的致敬演出。全是翻唱曲，一个人负责一首。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "なみちゃん的……！？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "场地不大。不过来看的人都是冲着音乐来的，是个很硬的场子。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "那个，是找我的吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……是找你们两个的。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "致敬演出，是对方对自己有意义，才会去做的事吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我在八雲なみ身上，留下过什么吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我几乎不了解她。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──那、那个！",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "我、我知道！我知道的！！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊、不是……那个，我不是那个意思……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……我，知道なみちゃん很多事。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "可是，那不能算美琴さん的回答吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我为什么去问美琴，你知道么。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "因为你是她的搭档。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我不知道。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……要再想一想。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好。那就等你想。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过有一件事我先说──我想你们两个一起站上去。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……知道了。我回去跟姐姐说一声。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──话说，なみちゃん的事，我可以讲很久哦。真的会讲很久。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哈哈，我听着。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那从现在开始！从『そうだよ』开始！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
